  "funFacts": [
    {
      "title": "Sahat-kula",
      "body": "Sarajevo’s clock tower near the Bey’s mosque is a landmark for meeting points and old lunar timekeeping stories. Look up — then look at your watch."
    },
    {
      "title": "Petak energy",
      "body": "Friday afternoon in the old town often feels like the week exhaling. Good day to practice Danas je petak out loud."
    },
    {
      "title": "Sat vs sati",
      "body": "You will hear both. This lesson’s safe kit: Jedan je sat for 1:00, and number + je sati for many other whole hours — then listen for local rhythm."
    },
    {
      "title": "Sutra u deset",
      "body": "Planning with sutra + u + number + sati is a Week 1 superpower. Emir uses it constantly."
    }
  ],
